  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal shown on the drawing submitted on 24th June 2025 and numbered 8GC-300-01A, 8GC-301-01C, 8GC-301-02C, 8GC-302-01C would not be lawful because:\r\nThe measurement does not include the infilling of the original enclosed porch that has taken place. As such the porch would measure greater than 3sqm. The proposed outbuilding would also be excessively sized and would not relate incidentally to the main dwelling.\r\nThe development therefore fails to comply with the terms of Classes D and E of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n"
